# NOTICE

## Upstream data

This project consumes the community-maintained API at <https://json.tarkov.dev>, provided by the
[tarkov.dev](https://tarkov.dev) project and the `the-hideout` community. The upstream API server
implementation is published under GPL-3.0:

- <https://github.com/the-hideout/tarkov-api>

This application is an independent client. It does not include or link upstream server code, and it
distributes normalized derivative data generated from the public API. We are grateful to the tarkov.dev
contributors and data maintainers for keeping the dataset open.

Item images are loaded from `https://assets.tarkov.dev`, operated by the same community project.

